      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Grant <chord name="Gm/Bb"/>us <chord name="Bb"/>new <chord name="Eb/Bb"/>courage, <chord name="Bb"/>Vsacrificial, <chord name="Gm"/>humble,<br/>
